From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Martin Lund <mrlund@hotmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 14:51:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 18/66] drm/panel: aa569: drop dsc_slice_per_pkt for 7.3

7.3 has no mipi_dsi_device::dsc_slice_per_pkt; one slice per packet is
the default without MIPI_DSI_MODE_DSC_ALL_SLICES_IN_PKT.
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-aa569-p-3-a0019-dsc.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-aa569-p-3-a0019-dsc.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-aa569-p-3-a0019-dsc.c
index 2888762f1..a641f825e 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-aa569-p-3-a0019-dsc.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-aa569-p-3-a0019-dsc.c
@@ -427,7 +427,7 @@ static int panel_aa569_p_3_a0019_dsc_probe(struct mipi_dsi_device *dsi)
 
 	ctx->dsc.slice_height = 22;
 	ctx->dsc.slice_width = 720;
-	ctx->dsi->dsc_slice_per_pkt = 1;
+	/* One slice per packet: the 7.3 default (no ALL_SLICES_IN_PKT). */
 	ctx->dsc.slice_count = 2;
 	ctx->dsc.convert_rgb = true;
 	ctx->dsc.bits_per_component = 10;
